    "title":  "下面代码的输出是什么？",
    "desc":  "```javascript\n[[0, 1], [2, 3]].reduce(\n  (acc, cur) =\u003e {\n    return acc.concat(cur)\n  },\n  [1, 2]\n)\n```",
